# Credentials for the monitor. Copy to /opt/stock-movement-monitor/.env and
# chmod 600 — systemd reads it as an EnvironmentFile.
#
# This file is gitignored. Never commit real values.
# `monitor verify` prints which of these your configuration actually needs.

# --- Alert delivery (required for notify.channel: telegram) -----------------
# @BotFather -> /newbot gives you the token. Then message your new bot once and
# read the chat id from https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/getUpdates —
# it is the "id" inside "chat".
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# --- SEC EDGAR (free, required for the insider signal) ---------------------
# EDGAR blocks anonymous requests. This must be a real contact address that
# reaches you; the monitor refuses to start the SEC source without an "@".
SEC_USER_AGENT=stock-movement-monitor you@example.com

# --- Financial Modeling Prep -----------------------------------------------
# Needed for intraday bars when sources.bars is `fmp`, and for the CAN SLIM
# scorecard's fundamentals regardless of where bars come from.
#
# Plan note: historical-chart and the statement endpoints require Starter or
# above. A free key authenticates successfully and then returns an entitlement
# error on exactly those calls — `monitor verify` surfaces it as such.
FMP_API_KEY=

# --- Claude (optional) ------------------------------------------------------
# Only used when canslim.narrator is `llm` or `hybrid`, where Claude fills the
# two CAN SLIM letters arithmetic cannot settle (N's "new" story, I's
# sponsorship quality). Also needs `pip install -r requirements-narrator.txt`.
# The deterministic scorecard works without any of this.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# --- Interactive Brokers ----------------------------------------------------
# IBKR has NO API key. The monitor talks to a Client Portal Gateway running on
# this machine, authenticated by a browser login that expires roughly daily.
# There is nothing to put here unless the gateway is not on localhost:5000.
#
# IBKR is what supplies per-contract OPEN INTEREST — the only figure in this
# project that shows a position was actually taken rather than merely traded.
#IBKR_BASE_URL=https://localhost:5000/v1/api
